---
title: Server Managers
description: Connect FOSSBilling to hosting control panels and provisioning systems.
---

Server managers let FOSSBilling create, suspend, unsuspend, and manage hosting accounts through external control panels or provisioning backends.

Review your control panel's supported actions before relying on automatic provisioning in production.

